# Project Context Ledger (.agent)

Last updated: 2026-08-16 (Prompt 10: Analytics, announcements, certificates, feedback, sponsors/speakers/sessions)
Repository: C:\Users\Hp\Documents\personal\event management
Default branch: main

## Purpose
This file is the persistent project context for AI-assisted chats.
It is the single source of truth for:
- current architecture and module inventory
- **mandatory** backend/frontend feature patterns (copy these, do not invent new ones)
- important conventions
- active runtime/dev state
- recent changes and reasoning

Every meaningful change to the codebase must also update this file.
**Other chats should be able to read only this file and correctly scaffold a new feature.**

## Current Runtime / Workspace State
- Full-stack Laravel + React SPA (Blade shell + Vite React app)
- Dev: `composer run dev` (Unix) or `composer run dev:windows` (Windows)
  - Laravel serve: `http://localhost:8000` (Unix) / `http://localhost:8002` (Windows script)
  - Vite HMR via `npm run dev` / pnpm Vite
  - Queue worker: `php artisan queue:listen`
- API base URL (axios): `/api/v1` (same-origin)
- Absolute API examples: `http://localhost:8000/api/v1` (or `:8002` on Windows)
- Health: `GET /up`; API ping: `GET /api/ping`
- Known gotchas:
  - Windows `dev:windows` uses port **8002**, not 8000
  - Lockfile is **pnpm** (`pnpm-lock.yaml`); npm also works
  - Queue/cache/session default to **database** — migrate before first run
  - Organizations logo columns: create migration includes `logo_dark_url`/`icon_url`; alter is `2025_08_24_090000_...` (never `2025_01_27_...` before create)
  - Do not commit `.env` or secrets
  - Organization is effectively **single-tenant profile** (not a full CRUD list page like Users)

## Tech Stack
### Backend
- PHP 8.2+, Laravel 12
- Auth: Laravel Sanctum (Bearer tokens)
- RBAC: spatie/laravel-permission (`permission:` / `role:` middleware aliases in `bootstrap/app.php`)
- Audit: spatie/laravel-activitylog (via `BaseController::logActivity`)
- Location: stevebauman/location
- Queue: `SendEmailJob`, `MailService`, **`ExpirePendingPayments`** (scheduled every 5 min)
- **Payments (Phase 6):** WaafiPay Hormuud EVC via `WaafiPayService` → `POST {WAAFI_BASE_URL}` (default `https://api.waafipay.net/asm`), credentials in `config/waafipay.php` / `.env` (`WAAFI_MERCHANT_UID`, `WAAFI_API_USER_ID`, `WAAFI_API_KEY`). **HTTP timeout 180s** (customer phone approval). Currency **USD** (platform assumption). Never log `apiKey`. Tests mock HTTP — never hit production.

### Frontend
- React 18 + TypeScript, Vite 5, `laravel-vite-plugin`
- Redux Toolkit + TanStack React Query
- React Router DOM 6 (`resources/js/src/router/routes.tsx`)
- UI: Tailwind 3, MUI, Mantine, Headless UI; shared `DataTableWithSidebar`, `GenericModal`
- Forms: React Hook Form / Formik; Yup / Zod
- i18n: i18next (`public/locales/{en,ae}/translation.json`)
- HTTP: `resources/js/src/utils/axios.ts` → `baseURL: "/api/v1"`

### Build / Tooling
- Composer + pnpm/npm
- PHPUnit (`composer test`), Laravel Pint, Vite
- Agent enforcement: `check-agent-update.sh`, `install-agent-hook.ps1`, `.github/workflows/agent-context-check.yml`

## Run Commands
- Install: `composer install`; `pnpm install` (or `npm install`)
- Env: `.env.example` → `.env`; `php artisan key:generate`; DB config; `php artisan migrate`; `php artisan db:seed`
- Primary dev: `composer run dev` / `composer run dev:windows`
- Tests: `composer test` / `php artisan test`
- Hook once: `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\install-agent-hook.ps1`

